{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumRegisterBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumRegisterBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumClosedForm","lean:module:QOU.Common.HookSumComplete"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.sum_hookZ_eq_bStat_via_reflections","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.sum_hookZ_eq_bStat_via_reflections","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumRegisterBridge.lean#L177-L184","doc":"The reflection route proves the very same proposition — same statement, so\nthe two derivations are not merely consistent, they are one theorem. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.sum_hookZ_eq_bStat_via_list","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.sum_hookZ_eq_bStat_via_list","kind":"theorem","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumRegisterBridge.lean#L151-L175","doc":"**The list-register closed form, transported.** `Σ_c hookZ = b(λ') + b(λ) + n`\nderived from `HookSumComplete.hookSum_eq` through the bridge — a second,\nindependent route to `HookSum.sum_hookZ_eq_bStat`, which proves the same\nproposition from the `YoungDiagram` arm/leg reflections instead. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.hookSum_rowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.hookSum_rowLens","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumRegisterBridge.lean#L128-L149","doc":"**The two hook sums are the same number.** `HookSumComplete.hookSum` of\n`μ.rowLens`, cast to `ℤ`, is `Σ_c hookZ μ c`.\n\nThe cellwise step is where the registers actually meet: the list side's\ntruncated `ℕ` subtraction agrees with `armZ`/`legZ` only because `j` indexes a\nreal cell of row `i`, which also forces `i < μ.colLen j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.rowLens_le_rowLen_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.rowLens_le_rowLen_zero","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumRegisterBridge.lean#L119-L124","doc":"`hookSum_eq`'s column-bound hypothesis at `M = μ.rowLen 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.rowLens_sorted'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.rowLens_sorted'","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumRegisterBridge.lean#L110-L117","doc":"`hookSum_eq`'s sortedness hypothesis, straight from `rowLen_anti` — no need\nto unpack `YoungDiagram.rowLens_sorted` into this shape. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.rowLens_sum_eq_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.rowLens_sum_eq_card","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumRegisterBridge.lean#L98-L106","doc":"The row lengths sum to the cell count. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.colLen_rowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.colLen_rowLens","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumRegisterBridge.lean#L79-L96","doc":"The list register's column length is the diagram's. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.rowLens_getD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.rowLens_getD","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumRegisterBridge.lean#L65-L77","doc":"`μ.rowLens.getD i 0 = μ.rowLen i`, for **every** `i`: inside the list by\n`get_rowLens`, past its end because both sides are `0`. The total form is what\nthe list-register statements need — they index by `getD` over\n`range l.length` and never carry a bound. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.rowLen_eq_zero_of_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBridge.rowLen_eq_zero_of_le","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumRegisterBridge.lean#L56-L63","doc":"Past the last nonempty row, the row length is zero. ","signatureChunk":0}]}